'''Inverted Sirius''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Wyld Woods}}. After the player gives them the {{Item|Stability Elixir}}, they allow {{Rift Transferable}} items to be transferred from the [[Rift]] to the main dimension and grant the {{Item|Doubloon of the Family}}.

